# sweep: --seed-root scripts/fixtures/crossword/unreadable-save
# A save the app cannot read is kept and explained, never silently replaced.
wait-for Cannot open progress
expect Your saved game has been kept.
expect Try again
expect-missing Odds and ends
clean
shot crossword-unreadable
# Trying again reads the same file and keeps refusing rather than starting over.
tap Try again
wait-for Cannot open progress
expect-missing Odds and ends
# Start over is the way past it: it asks first, keeps a copy of the
# unreadable progress, and the fresh shelf is what a restart finds.
expect Start over
tap Start over
wait-for Start over?
expect Your saved progress stays on the Kobo as a separate copy
clean
shot crossword-unreadable-start-over
tap Go back
wait-for Cannot open progress
tap Start over
wait-for Start over?
tap-id confirm-start-over
wait-for Odds and ends
expect 0/21 squares
restart
wait-for Odds and ends
expect-missing Cannot open progress
